source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: clickbench_q23"
---
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |  Limit: skip=0, fetch=10                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |   Sort: c DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |     Projection: hits.SearchPhrase, min(hits.URL), min(hits.Title), count(Int64(1)) AS c, count(DISTINCT hits.UserID)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |       Aggregate: groupBy=[[hits.SearchPhrase]], aggr=[[min(hits.URL), min(hits.Title), count(Int64(1)), count(DISTINCT hits.UserID)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |         Filter: hits.Title LIKE CAST(Utf8("%Google%") AS LargeUtf8) AND hits.URL NOT LIKE CAST(Utf8("%.google.%") AS LargeUtf8) AND hits.SearchPhrase != CAST(Utf8("") AS LargeUtf8)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |           TableScan: hits projection=[Title, UserID, URL, SearchPhrase]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=sqlite compute_context=//data/accelerated_sqlite.db base_sql=SELECT `hits`.`SearchPhrase`, min(`hits`.`URL`), min(`hits`.`Title`), count(1) AS `c`, count(DISTINCT `hits`.`UserID`) FROM `hits` WHERE ((`hits`.`Title` LIKE CAST('%Google%' AS TEXT) AND `hits`.`URL` NOT LIKE CAST('%.google.%' AS TEXT)) AND (`hits`.`SearchPhrase` <> CAST('' AS TEXT))) GROUP BY `hits`.`SearchPhrase` ORDER BY `c` DESC NULLS FIRST LIMIT 10 |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
